Still 1.2.0. A restructure rather than another patch.

Capture-on-demand produced about twenty defects across ten builds, nearly all the same shape: 'is the microphone open' lived in a dozen flags across four runtimes, and two of them disagreed.

It is one decision in one place now, from a tagged set of who is asking. The iOS half is a pure function with ten tests that run in milliseconds; it had none before.

New: an Audio block in Diagnostics, showing what was asked for against what happened.
